a</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Cantor</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>Grimalt</surname><given-names>JO</given-names></name><name><surname>Malats</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Silverman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Tardon</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Bladder cancer and exposure to water disinfection by-products through ingestion, bathing, showering, and swimming in pools</article-title><source>Am J Epidemiol</source><volume>165</volume><fpage>148</fpage><lpage>156</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17079692</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b16-ehp0115-001569"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Villanueva</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Cantor</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>King</surname><given-names>WD</given-names></name><name><surname>Jaakkola</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Cordier</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lynch</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006b</year><article-title>Total and specific fluid consumption as determinants of bladder cancer risk</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><volume>118</volume><fpage>2040</fpage><lpage>2047</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16284957</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b17-ehp0115-001569"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wilkens</surname><given-names>LR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kadir</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kolonel</surname><given-names>LN</given-names></name><name><surname>Nomura</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Hankin</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><year>1996</year><a